      "narrative": "Upon entering the cramped and salty galley, I set out to explore its contents and find useful items. I examined the kettle on the floor, noting its tin construction and a dent on one side. Intrigued by its presence, I picked it up only to decide it was heavier than anticipated and set it back down. Throughout my visit, the overwhelming saltiness of the space and the confined layout made it clear that this space had once been bustling and essential to the vessel's operations. I then decided to descend through the hatch in the floor, curious about what might lie beneath, marking the beginning of my downward journey into the depths of the ship.",
