      "run": 1,
      "steps": 4,
      "narrative": "During my exploration of the ship, I found myself in the salt-covered confines of the galley. I examined the kettle, a dented piece of tin that I decided to take with me. This discovery, coupled with the simple, yet functional layout of the room, offered a glimpse into the daily life of those aboard the vessel. The journey had been one of uncovering the vessel's past, and the galley was but one piece of the puzzle, a small yet significant detail that helped flesh out the picture of the ship's history.",
